SRAM / ANTENNA DIODE / FILLER LVS TREATMENT
==========================================

SRAM
----
Count in ECO netlist: 2 x gf180mcu_fd_ip_sram__sram256x8m8wm1
  u_transform_scheduler_core.u_fft_scratch_sram.u_lo.u_sram
  u_transform_scheduler_core.u_fft_scratch_sram.u_hi.u_sram

Official PDK views:
  spice: /foss/pdks/gf180mcuD/libs.ref/gf180mcu_fd_ip_sram/spice/gf180mcu_fd_ip_sram__sram256x8m8wm1.spice
  cdl:   /foss/pdks/gf180mcuD/libs.ref/gf180mcu_fd_ip_sram/cdl/gf180mcu_fd_ip_sram__sram256x8m8wm1.cdl
  lef:   /foss/pdks/gf180mcuD/libs.ref/gf180mcu_fd_ip_sram/lef/gf180mcu_fd_ip_sram__sram256x8m8wm1.lef
  maglef:/foss/pdks/gf180mcuD/libs.ref/gf180mcu_fd_ip_sram/maglef/gf180mcu_fd_ip_sram__sram256x8m8wm1.mag

The official SRAM spice/CDL is a FULL transistor netlist (comment FDC=16461), not a pin stub.

Supported GF180/LibreLane digital LVS treatment: BLACKBOX / LEF abstract at the macro boundary.
Do not flatten the SRAM hard macro against the 16k-device spice (not the PDK digital LVS methodology).

Layout: MAGIC_EXT_ABSTRACT_CELLS = gf180mcu_fd_ip_sram__sram256x8m8wm1
        (LibreLane extract_spice.tcl: load cell; property LEFview true)
        SRAM LEF is read after GDS so LEFview has pins.
Source: ECO powered Verilog instantiates the SRAM; SRAM transistor spice is NOT read,
        so the source SRAM is a pin-accurate black box matching the layout abstract.
Pin equivalence: Verilog/LEF pins CLK, CEN, GWEN, WEN[7:0], A[7:0], D[7:0], Q[7:0], VDD, VSS.
Require: SRAM instance count = 2.

Why valid: OpenPDKs ships maglef + LEF abstracts for this IP; LibreLane MAGIC_EXT_ABSTRACT_CELLS
is the supported hard-macro extract path. Full LVS of stdcells does not require flattening foundry SRAM.

ANTENNA DIODES
--------------
ECO netlist contains 14 instances ANTENNA_1 .. ANTENNA_14 of gf180mcu_fd_sc_mcu9t5v0__antenna.
Official SPICE/CDL: 2 diodes
  D0/d0  diode_nd2ps_06v0
  D1/d1  diode_pd2nw_06v0
LibreLane DIODE_CELL = gf180mcu_fd_sc_mcu9t5v0__antenna/I
gf180mcuD_setup.tcl: does NOT ignore antenna; property parallel enable.
Layout GDS preflight extracted the antenna cell to those 2 diodes.
They remain in the comparison (not deleted, not faked).

FILLER / ENDCAP / FILLTIE
-------------------------
Official SPICE/CDL: fill_*, filltie, endcap have 0 devices (physical-only cells).
gf180mcuD_setup.tcl ignore class:
  gf180mcu_fd_sc_[^_]+__endcap
  gf180mcu_fd_sc_[^_]+__fill_[[:digit:]]+
  gf180mcu_fd_sc_[^_]+__filltie
fillcap_* have MOSFETs (e.g. fillcap_8 has 4) and are compared, not ignored.
GDS cells are not deleted.
